=== WEB SOURCE (the specification — read end to end) ===
components/forms/SearchInput.tsx is a PRESENTATIONAL FORM PRIMITIVE: a debounced search field (leading
magnifier `icon` slot + trailing `suffix` clear button) wrapping the shared `<Input>`. The parent owns
the committed `value`; local typing is buffered in `local` and emitted via `onChange` only after
`debounceMs` (250) elapses (`if (local === value) return`). The clear button resets to '' and emits ''.
useId wires the combobox/listbox a11y ids; useTranslation supplies the copy.

When `historyScope` is set it adds a focus-gated "recent searches" dropdown, backed by the synchronous,
local lib/searchHistory.ts localStorage envelope `{ scopes: { [scope]: [{ q, ts }] } }` (key
`teslasync:search-history:v1`, CAP 12, MIN_QUERY_LEN 2, de-dup case-insensitive newest-first). dropdown
visibility = historyScope && showHistoryOnFocus && isFocused && local==='' && entries.length>0. Rows:
magnifier + query (select → adopt + emit immediately, skip debounce + re-record + refocus) and a remove
× (removeSearch + reload + clamp activeIdx + refocus). Footer: "Clear history" (clearScope). Keyboard:
ArrowDown/Up move activeIdx (min len-1 / max -1), Enter selects the active row else records the query,
Escape collapses. Blur commits the current query (>= MIN_QUERY_LEN) to history. onMouseEnter highlights.

FAITHFUL-PARITY NOTE (states): SearchInput's only data source is the synchronous, resilient localStorage
history — there is NO fetch / React-Query / Promise, so the source has NO network loading / error / stale
/ offline branch (nothing to fetch, fail, age, or lose connectivity to; storage failures degrade to an
empty list). Inventing such chrome would fabricate states the source does not have. This surface therefore
reproduces only the source's REAL branches — exactly as the accepted sibling presentational primitives
Accordion (0203), ActiveFilterChips (0147), TagInput (0160), MetricCard (0095), InlineCallout (0124).
The real branches reproduced: empty field (no clear, no dropdown), filled field (trailing clear),
history-less field (no scope), focused-empty recent-searches dropdown (populated), keyboard-highlighted
row, per-row remove + clear-all, blur/Enter record, and the native "never a blank box" empty-history leaf.

