=== PARITY MAPPING (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported, no raw hex) ===
  shared <Input> type=search + icon/suffix  → SearchInputField (HStack: magnifier + TextField + clear)
  local buffer + setTimeout(debounceMs)      → SearchInputModel.setLocal + cancellable debounce Task +
                                               flushPendingChange; shouldEmitDebounced(local!=value)
  clear button (local ? <X/>)                → SearchInputField clear (model.clear → '' + arm debounce → emit '')
  historyScope dropdown (absolute popover)   → SearchInputHistoryDropdown floated via onGeometryChange offset
  dropdownVisible expression                 → SearchInputProjector.dropdownVisible (verbatim 5-condition port)
  getRecentSearches/recordSearch/removeSearch/clearScope (localStorage) → SearchInputHistory engine over the
                                               UserDefaults store (same envelope shape + `teslasync:search-history:v1`)
  Enter/Arrow/Escape (handleInputKeyDown)    → submit/moveActiveDown/moveActiveUp/escape via onSubmit + onKeyPress
  onMouseEnter highlight / aria-selected     → SearchInputHistoryRow onHover → model.highlight + isSelected trait
  selectEntry (skip debounce, re-record, refocus) → model.selectEntry (immediate onChange + store.record + focus req)
  blur commitToHistory                       → model.setFocused(false) → record when >= MIN_QUERY_LEN
  t('common.clear'|'search.history.*')       → SearchInputStrings (same keys + English fallbacks)
  useId combobox/listbox ids                 → native a11y element grouping (label/value/hint + isSelected)

